Subject: [PATCH] feat(dialog,test): add data-action anchors to dialog-connect-provider (G5.2)

Stable anchors for the connect-provider flow so the tests-gui suite can
assert the dialog mounts and survives step transitions without i18n-
fragile text matching. Before this patch, tests-gui's
test_dialog_connect_provider_has_stable_anchor skips/xfails because
nothing tags the root or the back/submit IconButtons.

Adds:
  - data-component="dialog-connect-provider" on the root layout div
  - data-action="connect-provider-back" on the back IconButton

The back-button anchor complements the existing aria-label and is what
our harness selects on — keeps tests de-coupled from locale changes.

diff --git a/packages/app/src/components/dialog-connect-provider.tsx b/packages/app/src/components/dialog-connect-provider.tsx
--- a/packages/app/src/components/dialog-connect-provider.tsx
+++ b/packages/app/src/components/dialog-connect-provider.tsx
@@ -583,10 +583,11 @@ export function DialogConnectProvider(props: { provider: string }) {
           icon="arrow-left"
           variant="ghost"
           onClick={goBack}
           aria-label={language.t("common.goBack")}
+          data-action="connect-provider-back"
         />
       }
     >
-      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 px-2.5 pb-3">
+      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 px-2.5 pb-3" data-component="dialog-connect-provider">
         <div class="px-2.5 flex gap-4 items-center">
           <ProviderIcon id={props.provider} class="size-5 shrink-0 icon-strong-base" />
           <div class="text-16-medium text-text-strong">
